<title>USA: GTECH Holdings Corp issues $300 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>GTECH Holdings Corp issues $300 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTECH Holdings Corp on Monday said it completed a $300 million private placement two-tranche debt issue via lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p>GTECH, which supplies computerized on-line lottery products and services, said it will use the proceeds to facilitate future growth.</p>
